# TypeORM entities

- Use `@Entity()`, `@PrimaryColumn()` / `@PrimaryGeneratedColumn()`, `@Column()`, `@Index()` where needed. Prefer **kebab-case file names** for new entities (e.g. `team.entity.ts`, `series.entity.ts`); align with existing folder naming.
- Every entity must be registered in `src/data-source.ts` so TypeORM and CLI scripts see the schema.
- Use project enums for typed columns (e.g. `Conference`, `Round`) and keep entities in the feature folder or in an `entities/` subfolder for that feature.
